      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、魔物退治なら結構自信があるんだ。\r\n安心して任せてくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Of course. We’re pretty good at taking down monsters. Just leave the delivery to us.",
        "real_en": "Yeah, if it's monsters, we're pretty confident we can handle them. Leave it to us."
      },
      "review": {
