        "official_en_sha256": "eda24a17756450e002a2eb2b62394cdc13b5ca6d82c24814255badcbb46d99c6"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このままではスニウ村の病人が……。",
        "official_en": "If we don’t act quickly...I fear we’ll be too late to save their sick.",
        "real_en": "At this rate, the sick people in Sunioo Village..."
      },
