      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "大事より小事を取っているようではのう……。\r\nそれでは六盟傑の憎悪と信念には太刀打ちできんぞ。",
        "official_en": "’Twould seem you are prioritizing a much smaller matter... The enemy’s determination and hatred run deep. You shall surely falter against such conviction.",
        "real_en": "If you put a small matter ahead of a great one... You won't be able to stand against the Sworn Six's hatred and resolve."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
