      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "小さな人助けをしている間に\r\nクリスタルを六盟傑に壊されたらどうする？",
        "official_en": "And what if the Sworn Six destroy it as you’re out running this little errand?",
        "real_en": "What if the Sworn Six destroy the Crystal while you're helping a few people?"
